        en("ui.radios.hear.pinned.phone", "Sends map markers to ATAK, WinTAK, or iTAK. A radio you hear is pinned at this phone’s GPS, at the loudest point, and labeled (here). Walking away does not move the pin. A louder detection does. This is not direction finding. {privacy} pauses the feed.", LanguageSlot.BODY),
        en("ui.remote.id.aircraft.use", "Remote ID aircraft use the position in the advertisement. An operator location is a second pin: the takeoff spot, the pilot, or a fixed point.", LanguageSlot.BODY),
