        en("ui.each.phone.has.its", "Each phone keeps its own tag, so two phones are two markers. Export does not copy the tag. New tag starts a fresh marker for this phone. A name you typed stays. If the feed is on, markers this phone already sent can drop off.", LanguageSlot.BODY),
