        en("ui.custom.one.address.udp", "This phone sends to ATAK on this handset, at {loop}:{port}. LAN multicast is {multi}:{mport}, for other ATAK apps on this Wi-Fi. Custom is one UDP address. This is not a TAK server on TCP 8087. If This phone shows no pins, use Custom with the Wi-Fi address at the bottom of Settings and port {port}.", LanguageSlot.BODY),
