        en("ui.floods.label", "BLE Flood warnings", LanguageSlot.CONTROL),
        en("ui.adds.note.phone.s", "Adds a line on this phone’s marker while a Bluetooth flood is up, such as a store full of radios advertising pairing. A Wi-Fi beacon flood uses the same line. There is no separate pin, and the red line on Live stays as it is. The line does not name a tool or say it was one radio. This phone needs a GPS fix.", LanguageSlot.BODY),
